mac80211_hwsim: add bounded kernel-medium timing and airtime accounting

Add an optional high-resolution receive-delay queue with deterministic jitter,
a hard per-radio queue limit, and teardown draining.  Delay remains disabled
by default.  Also account approximate per-band airtime and temporal overlap
without yet turning overlap into collision loss.  The accounting is intended
to guide later collision work, not to claim complete CSMA/CA fidelity.

